---
<AssessmentPage page={page}>
<main class="wrap">
<a class="back" href="/curriculum/#lvl-B2">Back to curriculum</a>
<p class="overline">Complete B2 before advancing</p>
<h1>B2 End-of-Level Diagnostic</h1>
<p class="lede">Use this after all B2 lessons to identify any remaining gaps and confirm readiness for advanced independent English work.</p>
<div class="grid">
<section class="panel"><h2>Quiz Sections</h2><ul class="sections"><li><b>Language Range</b>Complex grammar, phrasal verbs, discourse markers, and collocation.</li><li><b>Skills</b>Longer listening and reading with inference and attitude questions.</li><li><b>Performance</b>Presentation, discussion, written argument, and communication repair.</li></ul></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Score Evidence</h2><ul class="rubric"><li>Can argue with reasons and examples.</li><li>Can understand longer texts and speech.</li><li>Can interact naturally enough for many professional and academic situations.</li></ul></section>
</div>
<p class="placeholder">Next build: create a capstone benchmark with a polished progress report for the student.</p>
</main>
</AssessmentPage>
